    f.write("# Prompts - cow-eyes\n\nEvery picture: ElevenLabs GPT Image 2.5 (`gpt-image-2.5-sunburst`), 1K, quality LOW, 1 variation, text prompt only (no reference, no edit). Flow: https://elevenlabs.io/app/flows/XYm4Yh6Hid6IZFvixfVb\n\n")
